<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Elandsrand, Deelkraal new cautionary.</title>
<headline>Elandsrand, Deelkraal new cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elandsrand Gold Mining Co and Deelkraal Gold Mining Co Ltd said on Monday that in the absence of any further developments since their last announcement on February 7, shareholders should continue to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>The two gold mines have been in talks for several months.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
